<title>SWEDEN: Reuters' fourth ex-Stockholm cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters' fourth ex-Stockholm cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Stockholm air cargo market rates per kg in Swedish crowns for a 100 kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one:</p>
<p>						     Oct 9	 Sept 13</p>
<p>		   UNITED STATES</p>
<p> STO-JFK					    9.75	   9.75</p>
<p> STO-CHI					   11.30	  11.30</p>
<p> STO-LAX					   12.70	  12.70</p>
<p>		   ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p> STO-HKG					   13.30	  13.30</p>
<p> STO-SIN					   13.30	  13.30</p>
<p> STO-NRT					   19.30	  19.40</p>
<p> STO-BKK					   13.00	  13.00</p>
<p>		    MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> STO-DXB					   10.25	  10.25</p>
<p>			  AFRICA</p>
<p> STO-JNB					   20.20	  20.60</p>
<p>			  EUROPE</p>
<p> STO-LON					    7.70	   7.70</p>
<p> STO-PAR					    7.50	   7.50</p>
<p>		 LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p> STO-SAO					   21.80	  21.80</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Stockholm's international Arlanda airport.</p>
<p>*All prices quoted in Swedish crowns.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative or current market activity.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
